  "exercises": [
    {
      "number": "138",
      "text": "138. \u4e0b\u5217\u6570\u5bf9\u662f\u65b9\u7a0b$x^2-3xy+y^2=31$\u7684\u89e3\u5417\uff1f\na) $(-3,-11)$\uff1b\nb) $(3,11)$\uff1b\nc) $(3,-2)$\uff1b\nd) $(-2,3)$\uff1b\ne) $(2,3)$\uff1b\nf) $(3+2\\sqrt{2},3-2\\sqrt{2})$\u3002",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
    {
      "number": "139",
      "text": "139. \u4e0b\u5217\u65b9\u7a0b\u5404\u6709\u51e0\u4e2a\u89e3\uff1f\na) $(x^2-7)(y^2+4)=0$\uff1b\nb) $(x-2y)(x^2+1)=0$\uff1b\nc) $(x^2-9)(y^2-4)=0$\uff1b\nd) $(x^2-9)^2+(y^2-4)^2=0$\uff1b\ne) $(x-y)(x^2+y^2)=0$\uff1b\nf) $(x-y)^2+(y-1)^2=0$\u3002",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
    {
      "number": "140",
      "text": "140. \u8bc1\u660e\u4e0b\u5217\u65b9\u7a0b\u65e0\u89e3\uff1a\na) $x^2-2xy+y^2+8=0$\uff1b\nb) $x^2+8x+y^2+17=0$\uff1b\nc) $x^2-10x+y^2+100=0$\uff1b\nd) $x^2-2xy+2y^2+4y+7=0$\u3002",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
    {
      "number": "141",
      "text": "141. \u8bc1\u660e\u4e0b\u5217\u65b9\u7a0b\u6709\u552f\u4e00\u89e3\uff1a\na) $x^2+6x+y^2-10y=-34$\uff1b\nb) $2x^2-6xy+9y^2-10x+25=0$\u3002",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
    {
      "number": "142",
      "text": "142. \u5217\u51fa\u4e0b\u9762\u5404\u79cd\u4e8c\u5143\u65b9\u7a0b\uff1a\na) \u6ca1\u6709\u89e3\uff1b\nb) \u6709\u4e00\u4e2a\u89e3\uff1b\nc) \u6709\u4e24\u4e2a\u89e3\uff1b\nd) \u6709\u4e09\u4e2a\u89e3\u3002",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
    {
      "number": "143",
      "text": "143. \u4e0b\u5217\u65b9\u7a0b\u6709\u6574\u6570\u89e3\u5417\uff1f\na) $3x-3y=4$\uff1b\nb) $xy=13$\uff1b\nc) $xy=-7.5$\uff1b\nd) $x-\\frac{7}{y^2}=1$\uff1b\ne) $\\frac{1}{x}+\\frac{1}{y}=\\frac{1}{6}$\uff1b\nf) $x^2-y^2=11$\u3002",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
    {
      "number": "144",
      "text": "144.\na) \u70b9$A(5,-4)$\u5728\u65b9\u7a0b$x^3+2y^2+3=0$\u7684\u56fe\u8c61\u4e0a\u5417\uff1f\nb) \u70b9$B(7,-3)$\u5728\u65b9\u7a0b$x^2-7x^2y-11xy^3+10x-19y+24=0$\u7684\u56fe\u8c61\u4e0a\u5417\uff1f",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
    {
      "number": "145",
      "text": "145. \u4f5c\u51fa\u4e0b\u5217\u65b9\u7a0b\u7684\u56fe\u8c61\uff1a\na) $(x-4)(y-3)=0$\uff1b\nb) $(x-1)(y-x)=0$\uff1b\nc) $(xy-6)(x+y)=0$\uff1b\nd) $x^2-y^2=0$\u3002",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
    {
      "number": "146",
      "text": "146. \u4f5c\u51fa\u4e0b\u5217\u65b9\u7a0b\u7684\u56fe\u8c61\uff1a\na) $|x|+y=4$\uff1b\nb) $x+|y|=4$\uff1b\nc) $|x|+|y|=4$\uff1b\nd) $|x|+|y|=x+y$\uff1b\ne) $|x|y=6$\uff1b\nf) $|xy|=6$\u3002",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
    {
      "number": "147",
      "text": "147. \u4f5c\u51fa\u4e0b\u5217\u65b9\u7a0b\u7684\u56fe\u8c61\uff1a\na) $y=-\\frac{5}{x}$\uff1b\nb) $xy=7.5$\u3002",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
    {
      "number": "148",
      "text": "148. \u4f5c\u51fa\u4e0b\u5217\u65b9\u7a0b\u7684\u56fe\u8c61\uff1a\na) $x^2+y^2=49$\uff1b\nb) $x^2+y^2=48$\uff1b\nc) $x^2+y^2=42.25$\uff1b\nd) $x^2+y^2=20.25$\u3002",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
    {
      "number": "149",
      "text": "149. \u5df2\u77e5\u5706\u5468$x^2+y^2=r^2$\u7ecf\u8fc7\u70b9$A(a,b)$\u3002\u8fd9\u4e2a\u5706\u5468\u7ecf\u8fc7\u4e0b\u5217\u5404\u70b9\u5417\uff1f$B(-a,b),\\ C(-a,-b),\\ D(a,-b),\\ E(b,a),\\ K(-b,a),\\ M(-b,-a)$\u3002",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
    {
      "number": "150",
      "text": "150. \u5df2\u77e5\u5706\u5468$x^2+y^2=r^2$\u7ecf\u8fc7\u70b9$A(8,15)$\uff0c\u4e0b\u5217\u5404\u70b9\u76f8\u5bf9\u4e8e\u8fd9\u4e2a\u5706\u5468\u662f\u600e\u6837\u7684\u4f4d\u7f6e\uff1f$B(7,16)$\uff0c$C(9,14)$\uff0c$D(-1,12\\sqrt{2})$\u3002",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
    {
      "number": "151",
      "text": "151. \u7528\u56fe\u89e3\u6cd5\u89e3\u4e0b\u5217\u65b9\u7a0b\u7ec4\uff1a\na) $\\begin{cases}x-y=1,\\\\xy=-12;\\end{cases}$\nb) $\\begin{cases}x+y=8,\\\\x^2+y^2=81;\\end{cases}$\nc) $\\begin{cases}2x+y=11,\\\\x^2+y^2=25;\\end{cases}$\nd) $\\begin{cases}y=x^2,\\\\3x+2y=3;\\end{cases}$\ne) $\\begin{cases}y+x+x^2=0,\\\\x-y=10;\\end{cases}$\nf) $\\begin{cases}x^2+y^2=10,\\\\xy=3.\\end{cases}$",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
    {
      "number": "152",
      "text": "152. \u7528\u4ee3\u5165\u6d88\u5143\u6cd5\u89e3\u4e0b\u5217\u65b9\u7a0b\u7ec4\uff1a\na) $\\begin{cases}2x-y=1,\\\\7x-y=9;\\end{cases}$\nb) $\\begin{cases}x-4y=5,\\\\x+8y=-7;\\end{cases}$\nc) $\\begin{cases}xy=48,\\\\x+2y=20;\\end{cases}$\nd) $\\begin{cases}3x-2y=6,\\\\xy=120;\\end{cases}$\ne) $\\begin{cases}x+xy-y=7,\\\\2x-y=-1;\\end{cases}$\nf) $\\begin{cases}4x-xy+3y=19,\\\\x+2y=-2.\\end{cases}$",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
    {
      "number": "153",
      "text": "153. \u89e3\u4e0b\u5217\u65b9\u7a0b\u7ec4\uff1a\na) $\\begin{cases}x+3y=-1,\\\\x^2+2xy+y^2=3;\\end{cases}$\nb) $\\begin{cases}2x-y=1,\\\\xy-y^2+3x=-1;\\end{cases}$\nc) $\\begin{cases}2x+y-11=0,\\\\2x+5y-y^2-6=0;\\end{cases}$\nd) $\\begin{cases}2x^2-3y^2-5x-2y=26,\\\\x-y=4;\\end{cases}$\ne) $\\begin{cases}4x^2-9y^2+x-40y-19=0,\\\\2x-3y=5;\\end{cases}$\nf) $\\begin{cases}3x^2+y^2+8x+13y=5,\\\\x-y+2=0.\\end{cases}$",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
    {
      "number": "154",
      "text": "154. $r$\u662f\u4ec0\u4e48\u6570\u65f6\uff0c\u4e0b\u5217\u65b9\u7a0b\u7ec4\u65e0\u89e3\uff1f$\\begin{cases}x^2+y^2=r^2,\\\\x+y=6.\\end{cases}$",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
    {
      "number": "155",
      "text": "155. $c$\u662f\u4ec0\u4e48\u6570\u65f6\uff0c\u4e0b\u5217\u65b9\u7a0b\u7ec4\u6709\u89e3\uff1f$\\begin{cases}x^2+y^2=100,\\\\x+y=c.\\end{cases}$",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
    {
      "number": "156",
      "text": "156. \u89e3\u4e0b\u5217\u65b9\u7a0b\u7ec4\uff1a\na) $\\begin{cases}\\frac{1}{x}+\\frac{1}{y}=\\frac{1}{6},\\\\2x-y=5;\\end{cases}$\nb) $\\begin{cases}\\frac{1}{x}-\\frac{1}{y}=\\frac{1}{20},\\\\x+2y=14;\\end{cases}$\nc) $\\begin{cases}x+y=14,\\\\\\frac{x}{y}+\\frac{y}{x}=2\\frac{1}{12};\\end{cases}$\nd) $\\begin{cases}x-y=2,\\\\\\frac{x}{y}-\\frac{y}{x}=\\frac{5}{6}.\\end{cases}$",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
    {
      "number": "157",
      "text": "157. \u89e3\u4e0b\u5217\u65b9\u7a0b\u7ec4\uff1a\na) $\\begin{cases}(x+y)(x-y)=0,\\\\2x-y=1;\\end{cases}$\nb) $\\begin{cases}x^2+y^2=25,\\\\(x-3)(y-5)=0;\\end{cases}$\nc) $\\begin{cases}x^2+y^2=100,\\\\(x-7y)(x+7y)=0;\\end{cases}$\nd) $\\begin{cases}x^2-y^2=50,\\\\x(y+1)=0.\\end{cases}$",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
    {
      "number": "158",
      "text": "158. \u6c42\u4e0b\u5217\u65b9\u7a0b\u7ec4\u7684\u89e3\u96c6\u5408\uff1a\na) $\\begin{cases}x^2+y^2=40,\\\\xy=-12;\\end{cases}$\nb) $\\begin{cases}x^2+y^2=80,\\\\xy=24;\\end{cases}$\nc) $\\begin{cases}x^2+y^2=15,\\\\xy=6;\\end{cases}$\nd) $\\begin{cases}x^2+y^2+xy=9,\\\\xy=-24.\\end{cases}$",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
