      "text": "159. \u4e0b\u5217\u65b9\u7a0b\u7ec4\u6709\u89e3\u5417\uff1f$\\begin{cases}x^2-3xy+y^2+x+2y=8,\\\\2x-5y=-1,\\\\3y-x=2.\\end{cases}$",
